# Source-only repository: track code, project files, docs and the Xbox build.
# Everything is ignored by default, then the whitelist below is applied.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README*
!LICENSE*
!*.cpp
!*.h
!*.hpp
!*.c
!*.inl
!*.vcxproj
!*.filters
!*.props
!*.targets
!*.sln
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.json
!*.toml
!*.bat
!*.ps1
!*.cfg
!*.xml
!*.fx
!*.fxh
!*.hlsl
!*.glsl
!*.vert
!*.frag
!*.comp
!*.csv
!*.lang
!*.def
!*.rc
!*.ico
!/Xbox360-Build/default.xex

# Never track these, even if a whitelist rule above matches inside them.
bin/
obj/
_sdk_install/
.vs/
repo/
src/
dist/
